1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,046
Over high mountains and across deep valleys

2
00:00:05,407 --> 00:00:08,613
A ninja's body like a plane, flying freely across the sky

3
00:00:08,865 --> 00:00:12,298
Honest and kind, Hattori is loved by all

4
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:15,632
Eyes open wide, lips sealed tight

5
00:00:15,965 --> 00:00:19,366
Face concealed under a mask, cheeks puffed out

6
00:00:19,532 --> 00:00:22,690
Catching villains swiftly, fast as a flash of lightning

7
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,457
Catching bad guys with strange tricks just like magic

8
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:29,836
Speaking like poetry, polite and dashing

9
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:33,739
"Who's Pretending to Be a Ghost?"

10
00:00:40,852 --> 00:00:42,133
Oh dear...

11
00:00:42,173 --> 00:00:43,704
I seem to be a bit drunk

12
00:00:45,833 --> 00:00:49,981
Taking this shortcut will get me home faster

13
00:00:51,262 --> 00:00:53,678
Oh no! Drinking too much really isn't good

14
00:00:57,034 --> 00:00:59,301
Whoa, why is this house so creepy?

15
00:01:02,032 --> 00:01:05,312
Aaargh...

16
00:01:06,166 --> 00:01:08,569
Help...

17
00:01:08,756 --> 00:01:11,089
Aaargh, help me...

18
00:01:14,174 --> 00:01:16,809
I... I really heard calls for help

19
00:01:16,850 --> 00:01:19,529
But the people living in that house moved out a week ago

20
00:01:19,582 --> 00:01:21,215
Nobody lives there now

21
00:01:21,255 --> 00:01:23,697
No, really, I definitely heard cries for help

22
00:01:23,737 --> 00:01:25,219
Did you get drunk?

23
00:01:25,259 --> 00:01:26,868
I believe what Dad said

24
00:01:26,909 --> 00:01:29,349
If it were me, my knees would have buckled from fear too

25
00:01:29,996 --> 00:01:32,467
That house is definitely a bit strange

26
00:01:32,507 --> 00:01:34,837
I also believe something strange is going on

27
00:01:35,695 --> 00:01:37,826
Hey, why don't we go check it out together?

28
00:01:37,867 --> 00:01:38,620
Sure

29
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:40,686
I really want to go check it out too

30
00:01:40,856 --> 00:01:41,656
What about you?

31
00:01:41,696 --> 00:01:43,296
Are you coming with me?

32
00:01:43,337 --> 00:01:44,856
Uh... I think I'll pass

33
00:01:44,896 --> 00:01:46,936
Because I have some things to do today

34
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:49,536
Yeah, I'm really sorry, I'll get going now

35
00:01:49,577 --> 00:01:50,417
Bye-bye

36
00:01:50,457 --> 00:01:51,781
Oh, Kenichi

37
00:01:51,821 --> 00:01:53,047
Nothing bad will happen, right?

38
00:01:53,088 --> 00:01:54,577
Ah, I'm sure it won't

39
00:02:02,967 --> 00:02:05,551
Looks like no one's inside, let's go in and take a look

40
00:02:08,857 --> 00:02:09,611
Is that so?

41
00:02:09,651 --> 00:02:12,056
-You scared me!
-Kenichi, let's not go inside

42
00:02:12,097 --> 00:02:13,498
I don't want to go in either

43
00:02:13,539 --> 00:02:15,249
Kenichi!

44
00:02:16,274 --> 00:02:19,014
Looks like so much fun, let's go on an adventure together

45
00:02:19,088 --> 00:02:19,947
Let's go together

46
00:02:19,988 --> 00:02:21,598
Oh, it's you, Shinzo?

47
00:02:21,791 --> 00:02:23,211
Ling...

48
00:02:34,081 --> 00:02:35,620
Right... so that's how it is

49
00:02:35,661 --> 00:02:36,661
All right

50
00:02:39,061 --> 00:02:41,648
Excuse me... is anyone here?

51
00:02:43,335 --> 00:02:45,281
No way, I'm heading home

52
00:02:45,322 --> 00:02:46,655
I... I'm leaving too

53
00:02:46,696 --> 00:02:48,281
Kenichi, don't leave!

54
00:02:48,321 --> 00:02:50,396
Oh man, how can I not?

55
00:02:53,810 --> 00:02:55,976
Oh no, the door is locked, what should we do?

56
00:02:57,609 --> 00:02:59,279
What... what should we do?

57
00:02:59,402 --> 00:03:01,816
The door won't open, how are we going to get out?

58
00:03:01,857 --> 00:03:03,188
-Yeah
-What should we do?

59
00:03:03,229 --> 00:03:04,109
All right

60
00:03:04,149 --> 00:03:06,374
Let's go up to the second floor and have a look

61
00:03:06,484 --> 00:03:07,484
- All right
- Hey...

62
00:03:07,525 --> 00:03:08,523
Don't open it yet

63
00:03:08,564 --> 00:03:10,120
I can't move right now

64
00:03:10,161 --> 00:03:12,085
Then you stay here by yourself

65
00:03:12,132 --> 00:03:14,798
Hey... don't be like that

66
00:03:19,937 --> 00:03:22,644
Shinzo, wait for me!

67
00:03:25,905 --> 00:03:28,338
Ling...

68
00:03:35,046 --> 00:03:36,498
You're quite brave

69
00:03:36,539 --> 00:03:38,081
barging into this house, aren't you?

70
00:03:38,121 --> 00:03:39,840
Hey, who are you?

71
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:41,060
You wouldn't know me

72
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:43,238
I'm the vengeful ghost of this mansion

73
00:03:43,278 --> 00:03:44,957
Trespassing in here

74
00:03:44,997 --> 00:03:46,676
I'm going to swallow you whole!

75
00:03:46,716 --> 00:03:48,229
Do you understand?

76
00:03:48,270 --> 00:03:49,833
I'll eat you from head to toe!

77
00:03:49,873 --> 00:03:51,472
Oh no, let's get out of here quick!

78
00:03:51,512 --> 00:03:52,634
Where can we even run now?

79
00:03:52,675 --> 00:03:55,190
We can't get out downstairs, let's go up!

80
00:03:55,231 --> 00:03:56,830
Hurry up!

81
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:58,687
W-Wait for me!

82
00:04:05,664 --> 00:04:06,432
Hey...

83
00:04:06,472 --> 00:04:09,053
Shishimaru, stop pulling my shirt

84
00:04:09,094 --> 00:04:10,880
- I'm not...
- Ah, Shishimaru is in front!

85
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,166
Th-Then that means...

86
00:04:12,206 --> 00:04:14,418
Ah, please let go of me!

87
00:04:14,459 --> 00:04:17,205
I don't have any meat on me, don't eat me!

88
00:04:17,246 --> 00:04:18,195
Help!

89
00:04:18,235 --> 00:04:19,716
Kenichi, what's wrong?

90
00:04:19,756 --> 00:04:22,475
S-Someone is grabbing me!

91
00:04:22,849 --> 00:04:24,037
Someone's grabbing you?

92
00:04:24,077 --> 00:04:25,915
A nail just caught on your shirt

93
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,280
Where are you going?

94
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:35,940
I'm going to start swallowing you up now!

95
00:04:36,121 --> 00:04:37,962
Hiding like this is too cowardly!

96
00:04:38,002 --> 00:04:39,660
Come out now!

97
00:04:47,807 --> 00:04:49,774
Yan...

98
00:04:50,168 --> 00:04:51,007
Yan

99
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,965
Huh? Yan...

100
00:04:53,005 --> 00:04:55,377
Oh no, this is bad, we're in trouble

101
00:04:55,485 --> 00:04:57,455
All right, Ninja Art: Wall Scaling!

102
00:04:57,725 --> 00:04:59,365
Yan...

103
00:05:00,809 --> 00:05:02,977
- Help...
- Ah...

104
00:05:08,192 --> 00:05:10,306
I'm going to eat all of you!

105
00:05:15,964 --> 00:05:17,884
Huh? Why did this happen?

106
00:05:17,947 --> 00:05:20,402
Who played such a prank and tied you up?

107
00:05:20,443 --> 00:05:21,765
How awful!

108
00:05:29,005 --> 00:05:32,528
You can't escape now, prepare to die!

109
00:05:46,781 --> 00:05:48,445
Oh, Hattori-kun?

110
00:05:48,675 --> 00:05:50,716
Turns out that sound of a woman crying for help

111
00:05:50,756 --> 00:05:51,956
was made by a parrot

112
00:05:51,996 --> 00:05:54,133
Kemumaki, you're awful!

113
00:05:55,838 --> 00:05:56,991
Well, then...

114
00:06:05,587 --> 00:06:07,821
I'm a real vengeful ghost

115
00:06:07,862 --> 00:06:10,000
and I'm going to kill you

116
00:06:10,825 --> 00:06:13,548
Haha, serves you right this time!

117
00:06:14,944 --> 00:06:17,075
- Yay!
- Yay!

118
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:22,477
The saying 'evil brings evil upon itself' is totally true

119
00:06:22,517 --> 00:06:24,558
It's so true, yan...

120
00:06:26,502 --> 00:06:28,823
"Kagechiyo Incubates an Egg"

121
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,412
And just like that

122
00:06:35,452 --> 00:06:37,876
those chicks will slowly grow up

123
00:06:38,137 --> 00:06:40,469
And then the hens will lay eggs

124
00:06:41,396 --> 00:06:42,016
You see

125
00:06:42,057 --> 00:06:44,864
So all of you will have eggs to eat, right?

126
00:06:45,091 --> 00:06:47,363
Teacher, even without a hen

127
00:06:47,404 --> 00:06:49,688
can eggs hatch into chicks on their own?

128
00:06:49,728 --> 00:06:52,542
That's right, you all just saw it in the slides

129
00:07:00,306 --> 00:07:02,460
What are you looking for in the fridge?

130
00:07:05,483 --> 00:07:06,606
I'm looking for an egg

131
00:07:06,646 --> 00:07:09,206
Do you want to fry an egg to eat?

132
00:07:09,399 --> 00:07:11,740
No, I want to do an experiment

133
00:07:12,334 --> 00:07:15,307
It's so rare for Kenichi to study so hard

134
00:07:17,619 --> 00:07:19,657
If I hatch this egg into a chick

135
00:07:19,698 --> 00:07:21,270
and raise it into a hen

136
00:07:21,311 --> 00:07:22,579
If I have a hen

137
00:07:22,619 --> 00:07:24,779
then I can eat fresh eggs every day

138
00:07:24,826 --> 00:07:26,822
Wouldn't that be great?

139
00:07:27,339 --> 00:07:28,940
Then hurry up and incubate the egg

140
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:30,938
I want to join too!

141
00:07:31,380 --> 00:07:33,519
I want to help hatch the egg too!

142
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,813
Yan...

143
00:07:43,098 --> 00:07:44,257
Oh, no change

144
00:07:44,298 --> 00:07:45,786
That's strange

145
00:07:46,259 --> 00:07:48,245
I had full faith in this incubation method

146
00:07:48,286 --> 00:07:50,792
The temperature doesn't seem high enough

147
00:07:51,334 --> 00:07:52,574
That's true

148
00:07:58,940 --> 00:08:01,249
Brrr, it's so cold, so cold!

149
00:08:02,572 --> 00:08:03,306
Ah, Mom!

150
00:08:03,347 --> 00:08:05,680
You can't put your feet under the blanket! Don't!

151
00:08:05,721 --> 00:08:07,251
Huh, what's going on?

152
00:08:07,291 --> 00:08:09,533
It's nothing, you just can't!

153
00:08:09,777 --> 00:08:11,010
-What are you doing?
-Just don't worry about it!

154
00:08:11,051 --> 00:08:12,371
Please go outside

155
00:08:13,569 --> 00:08:14,644
What was that about?

156
00:08:15,437 --> 00:08:16,591
That egg just now

157
00:08:16,632 --> 00:08:18,208
Mom almost crushed it!

158
00:08:18,249 --> 00:08:19,058
Yeah

159
00:08:19,344 --> 00:08:21,806
It's really strange, why hasn't it changed at all?

160
00:08:21,847 --> 00:08:25,195
Could it be that this incubation temperature still isn't hot enough?

161
00:08:26,058 --> 00:08:27,784
Hattori-kun, what do you think?

162
00:08:28,044 --> 00:08:28,865
All right

163
00:08:28,905 --> 00:08:30,680
Let me check the reference books

164
00:08:30,721 --> 00:08:32,221
Hopefully I can find

165
00:08:32,262 --> 00:08:34,294
the correct answer for you

166
00:08:34,347 --> 00:08:35,421
-Mm
-Mm

167
00:08:46,945 --> 00:08:48,578
Indeed

168
00:08:48,625 --> 00:08:50,345
So that's how it is

169
00:08:59,418 --> 00:09:01,066
Ouch, it's so hot!

170
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:06,186
Oh no, what do we do now?

171
00:09:06,227 --> 00:09:08,315
It's no good, it's too hot

172
00:09:08,427 --> 00:09:09,609
It's not working?

173
00:09:10,518 --> 00:09:13,151
Wait, is there really such a kind of egg?

174
00:09:13,192 --> 00:09:14,278
That's right

175
00:09:14,318 --> 00:09:16,984
If a rooster and a hen have never married

176
00:09:17,024 --> 00:09:20,159
then the eggs they lay can never hatch

177
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,485
Meaning the eggs we have at home

178
00:09:22,526 --> 00:09:25,953
can never hatch into chicks no matter what

179
00:09:41,444 --> 00:09:42,671
We can just take them?

180
00:09:42,881 --> 00:09:44,381
Oh, of course you can

181
00:09:45,237 --> 00:09:46,152
Yay!

182
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,710
This one, this one's bigger!

183
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:04,248
That egg looks pretty tasty

184
00:10:08,628 --> 00:10:10,829
This time, it'll definitely turn into a chick!

185
00:10:10,870 --> 00:10:12,521
That'd make me so happy

186
00:10:13,682 --> 00:10:15,068
Be careful

187
00:10:24,041 --> 00:10:25,688
Nobody's around now

188
00:10:31,046 --> 00:10:33,619
The more I look at it, the tastier it seems

189
00:10:37,096 --> 00:10:38,279
Yan...

190
00:10:45,017 --> 00:10:47,116
Kagechiyo, you've been a menace for too long

191
00:10:47,157 --> 00:10:50,113
I'll turn you into a hen, a hen that broods eggs

192
00:10:50,153 --> 00:10:52,271
Go on and brood the egg, yan...

193
00:10:59,238 --> 00:11:00,729
Now you sit on that egg

194
00:11:00,769 --> 00:11:02,851
until it hatches!

195
00:11:08,243 --> 00:11:10,723
I'm very pleased with your performance

196
00:11:24,098 --> 00:11:25,577
It's really unbelievable

197
00:11:25,618 --> 00:11:27,912
Kagechiyo really thinks he's a hen!

198
00:11:27,998 --> 00:11:30,121
Has he forgotten he's a cat?

199
00:11:30,161 --> 00:11:31,601
If we don't undo the jutsu

200
00:11:31,641 --> 00:11:33,483
he'll still think he's a hen

201
00:11:34,385 --> 00:11:36,133
Something's not quite right

202
00:11:40,398 --> 00:11:42,065
Looks like it worked!

203
00:11:50,562 --> 00:11:53,156
Oh dear, turns out I took a duck egg by mistake!

204
00:11:53,197 --> 00:11:55,640
The duckling thinks Kagechiyo is its mommy!

205
00:11:56,640 --> 00:11:57,605
Yan!

206
00:11:59,443 --> 00:12:00,486
What's going on?

207
00:12:01,488 --> 00:12:04,606
Oh no...

208
00:12:04,646 --> 00:12:06,382
No... I'm a cat!

209
00:12:06,423 --> 00:12:07,565
I'm not your mother!

210
00:12:07,605 --> 00:12:09,750
No...

211
00:12:09,791 --> 00:12:11,083
Stop chasing me!

212
00:12:11,203 --> 00:12:13,718
Oh no, I'm not...

213
00:12:13,891 --> 00:12:15,680
This experiment was pretty successful overall

214
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:18,844
The only flaw was mistaking a duck egg for a chicken egg

215
00:12:18,885 --> 00:12:20,061
Yan...

216
00:12:23,072 --> 00:12:25,275
"Year-End Cleaning Is Such a Pain"

217
00:12:38,612 --> 00:12:40,119
Hurry up and carry them out, hey

218
00:12:40,785 --> 00:12:42,210
Coming... They're so heavy!

219
00:12:42,251 --> 00:12:43,391
Why do we have to carry the tatami mats

220
00:12:43,432 --> 00:12:45,765
all the way out here?

221
00:12:45,805 --> 00:12:47,719
It's the annual year-end cleaning, after all

222
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:50,168
Ugh, why do we have to do year-end cleaning anyway?

223
00:12:50,209 --> 00:12:52,594
Because traditionally, we have to clear out the dirt

224
00:12:52,635 --> 00:12:55,290
and welcome the new year with a clean mindset!

225
00:12:59,693 --> 00:13:02,101
Shishimaru, come help wipe the windows

226
00:13:02,142 --> 00:13:03,383
Okay...

227
00:13:05,269 --> 00:13:07,435
Let me add some soap powder first

228
00:13:18,971 --> 00:13:20,269
Ah, you're really clever!

229
00:13:20,310 --> 00:13:22,330
Keep wiping like that, okay?

230
00:13:22,370 --> 00:13:24,303
Just leave it all to me!

231
00:13:24,403 --> 00:13:25,803
Hey, Shishimaru

232
00:13:25,843 --> 00:13:27,328
That looks like fun to me too

233
00:13:27,368 --> 00:13:29,047
Let me give you a hand

234
00:13:29,087 --> 00:13:31,378
No need, I can handle the windows myself

235
00:13:31,419 --> 00:13:32,596
Go play outside!

236
00:13:32,637 --> 00:13:34,002
No way!

237
00:13:34,925 --> 00:13:37,044
Mom, I want to help too!

238
00:13:37,084 --> 00:13:39,425
Huh, Shinzo? Ah... you...

239
00:13:39,466 --> 00:13:42,002
Mom, I actually know how to do everything

240
00:13:42,043 --> 00:13:44,777
Oh, never mind that, go out and play, okay?

241
00:13:44,917 --> 00:13:47,718
No way, everyone gets to help with spring cleaning

242
00:13:47,759 --> 00:13:50,400
Why don't I get to? I have to join in!

243
00:13:52,930 --> 00:13:54,380
That's it

244
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:56,152
Let me help wipe it clean

245
00:14:09,261 --> 00:14:10,748
I'm sorry!

246
00:14:10,945 --> 00:14:12,443
Shinzo, you're just getting in the way!

247
00:14:12,483 --> 00:14:14,146
I don't need your help, go outside and play

248
00:14:14,187 --> 00:14:15,982
Oh, okay...

249
00:14:19,627 --> 00:14:21,347
Wow, this looks like so much fun!

250
00:14:21,387 --> 00:14:23,227
I want to join in too

251
00:14:23,267 --> 00:14:24,907
Hey, what are you doing anyway?

252
00:14:24,947 --> 00:14:26,198
We're beating the tatami mats

253
00:14:26,239 --> 00:14:27,874
To keep the dust from building up, you know

254
00:14:27,915 --> 00:14:29,452
Can I try beating them too?

255
00:14:29,493 --> 00:14:30,967
Hey, don't get in our way

256
00:14:31,610 --> 00:14:33,236
Shinzo, you're a good boy

257
00:14:33,277 --> 00:14:35,013
But don't get in the way of people working

258
00:14:35,054 --> 00:14:35,813
Go on outside and play

259
00:14:35,854 --> 00:14:38,707
You're all ganging up on me and leaving me out

260
00:14:38,748 --> 00:14:40,368
I'm not talking to you guys!

261
00:14:41,179 --> 00:14:42,509
I'm so mad!

262
00:14:44,956 --> 00:14:46,306
What are you doing?

263
00:14:46,399 --> 00:14:48,086
I'm sorry

264
00:14:49,064 --> 00:14:51,831
There's really no helping this little guy

265
00:14:53,866 --> 00:14:56,680
*sigh* This is so boring...

266
00:14:56,787 --> 00:14:58,588
Huh? There are so many comic books here

267
00:14:58,628 --> 00:15:00,500
Let me read some comic books first

268
00:15:02,141 --> 00:15:04,290
Turns out this is the comfiest way

269
00:15:04,609 --> 00:15:06,505
Oh dear, I'm so busy

270
00:15:06,553 --> 00:15:07,652
Once you're done wiping the windows

271
00:15:07,693 --> 00:15:09,371
go help clean the bathtub outside, okay?

272
00:15:09,753 --> 00:15:10,861
Sure thing

273
00:15:11,197 --> 00:15:12,327
I got it

274
00:15:23,488 --> 00:15:24,661
Shinzo...

275
00:15:24,890 --> 00:15:25,811
With everyone spring cleaning

276
00:15:25,851 --> 00:15:27,656
it's best for him to sleep right here

277
00:15:28,116 --> 00:15:30,943
Anyway, Shinzo, have a good sleep, okay?

278
00:15:31,217 --> 00:15:34,174
No one lets me join in...

279
00:15:39,597 --> 00:15:41,988
Dad, you're reading old newspapers again

280
00:15:42,081 --> 00:15:43,450
Habit becomes second nature

281
00:15:43,523 --> 00:15:45,470
Yan...

282
00:15:52,632 --> 00:15:54,959
Yan...

283
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,803
Yan...

284
00:15:58,532 --> 00:15:59,220
Yan...

285
00:16:09,004 --> 00:16:11,257
Looks like a 100-yen coin dropped earlier

286
00:16:12,395 --> 00:16:14,288
Ouch!

287
00:16:15,447 --> 00:16:17,327
Turns out it was just a bottle cap

288
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,613
It's looking pretty clean around here

289
00:16:25,514 --> 00:16:27,881
All right, once we throw out all this trash

290
00:16:27,922 --> 00:16:30,143
our spring cleaning will be a success!

291
00:16:40,682 --> 00:16:42,640
We worked so hard today, I'm starving!

292
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,763
All right, we brought some rice balls to reward you all

293
00:16:44,803 --> 00:16:45,729
Awesome!

294
00:16:45,770 --> 00:16:47,884
Shinzo loves this kind of food the most

295
00:16:47,938 --> 00:16:49,429
Where's Shinzo?

296
00:16:50,069 --> 00:16:52,783
You're right, I haven't seen Shinzo at all

297
00:16:55,682 --> 00:16:56,922
Oh no, he's gone missing!

298
00:16:56,963 --> 00:16:58,442
What happened, Mom?

299
00:16:58,508 --> 00:16:59,739
Shinzo...

300
00:16:59,811 --> 00:17:01,036
was sleeping in a cardboard box

301
00:17:01,077 --> 00:17:02,642
How could he have vanished?

302
00:17:03,076 --> 00:17:04,749
Was he mistaken for trash?

303
00:17:07,529 --> 00:17:08,899
Oh no, he's not here!

304
00:17:08,940 --> 00:17:12,166
-Could the garbage truck have taken him away?
-Oh no, we're too late!

305
00:17:19,595 --> 00:17:23,575
-Oh dear, Shinzo...
-Shinzo!

306
00:17:24,417 --> 00:17:27,337
I searched all the cardboard boxes, but nothing

307
00:17:27,476 --> 00:17:29,358
We looked everywhere and still can't find him

308
00:17:29,399 --> 00:17:31,049
Shishimaru, found anything?

309
00:17:31,142 --> 00:17:33,501
I can't smell his scent at all

310
00:17:33,901 --> 00:17:35,574
Now we're really in trouble

311
00:17:37,908 --> 00:17:41,027
If we'd known, we shouldn't have ignored Shinzo like that

312
00:17:47,242 --> 00:17:47,861
What's that?

313
00:17:47,902 --> 00:17:49,619
It's snoring

314
00:17:49,982 --> 00:17:50,849
Huh?

315
00:17:52,756 --> 00:17:54,296
Ah, Shinzo!

316
00:17:55,209 --> 00:17:56,825
Shinzo, honestly...

317
00:17:56,865 --> 00:17:59,577
Unbelievable! You had us so worried

318
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:02,443
Look at how cute he looks

319
00:18:04,715 --> 00:18:06,260
You're all being so mean

320
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:08,257
I'm not helping you

321
00:18:10,155 --> 00:18:12,017
Because what I hate most is spring cleaning!

322
00:18:12,058 --> 00:18:13,044
I'm not playing with you!

323
00:18:13,085 --> 00:18:16,018
Now that we found Shinzo, everyone's happy

324
00:18:16,059 --> 00:18:17,832
Yan...

